# Harmonious Grovestrider, a */*: power and toughness each equal the number of lands you control, in every zone (the ruling, CR 604.3): in Bot1's hand it is a 0/0 before and a 1/1 after
# one Forest is played, and a 1/1 on the battlefield. Bot2's Island adds nothing ("you control"); Bot1's second land on turn 3 makes it a 2/2 (CR 613.4a). Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# at it meets ward {2} (CR 702.21a): Bot2 does not pay, so the Bolt is countered and the 1/1 lives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Harmonious Grovestrider
Forest
Plains
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

